;; minimum as a compare, -2^k as the negated quotient by 2^k; and the
;; remainders through each of those.  Every export folds op(n, d) over a
;; table of dividends, the extremes and the multiples of d among them, into a
;; hash, so one wrong quotient changes the answer.  (Generated; the dividend
;; table is the data segment, i32 at 0, i64 at 136.)
